{"id":80,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"'Abasa wa tawallaa.","translation":"The Prophet frowned and turned away"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"An jaa-ahul 'a-maa","translation":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting]."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wa maa yudreeka la'allahu yaz zakkaa.","translation":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Au yaz zak karu fatanfa 'ahuz zikraa.","translation":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Amma manis taghnaa","translation":"As for he who thinks himself without need,"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta lahu tasaddaa","translation":"To him you give attention."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wa ma 'alaika allaa yaz zakka.","translation":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa amma man jaa-aka yas'a","translation":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","transliteration":"Wahuwa yakhshaa,","translation":"While he fears [Allah],"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta 'anhu talah haa.","translation":"From him you are distracted."},{"number":11,"arabicText":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Kalla innaha tazkirah","translation":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder;"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faman shaa a zakarah","translation":"So whoever wills may remember it."},{"number":13,"arabicText":"فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fi suhufim mukar rama,","translation":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Marfoo'atim mutah hara,","translation":"Exalted and purified,"},{"number":15,"arabicText":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Bi'aidee safara","translation":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Kiraamim bararah.","translation":"Noble and dutiful."},{"number":17,"arabicText":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Qutilal-insanu maa akfarah.","translation":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he."},{"number":18,"arabicText":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min aiyyi shai-in Khalaq","translation":"From what substance did He create him?"},{"number":19,"arabicText":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min nutfah; khalaqahu faqad-darah.","translation":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;"},{"number":20,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thummas sabeela yas-sarah","translation":"Then He eased the way for him;"},{"number":21,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma amatahu fa-aqbarah","translation":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him."},{"number":22,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma iza shaa-a ansharah","translation":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him."},{"number":23,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Kalla lamma yaqdi maa amarah.","translation":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him."},{"number":24,"arabicText":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"Falyanzuril insanu ilaa ta-amih","translation":"Then let mankind look at his food -"},{"number":25,"arabicText":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Anna sabab nalmaa-a sabba.","translation":"How We poured down water in torrents,"},{"number":26,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا","transliteration":"Thumma sha qaqnal-arda shaqqa.","translation":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],"},{"number":27,"arabicText":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Fa ambatna feeha habba","translation":"And caused to grow within it grain"},{"number":28,"arabicText":"وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا","transliteration":"Wa 'inabaw-wa qadba","translation":"And grapes and herbage"},{"number":29,"arabicText":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا","transliteration":"Wa zaitoonaw wanakh la'","translation":"And olive and palm trees"},{"number":30,"arabicText":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا","transliteration":"Wa hadaa-iqa ghulba","translation":"And gardens of dense shrubbery"},{"number":31,"arabicText":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Wa faki hataw-wa abba.","translation":"And fruit and grass -"},{"number":32,"arabicText":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","transliteration":"Mata'al-lakum wa li-an'amikum.","translation":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock."},{"number":33,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","transliteration":"Faiza jaa-atis saakhah.","translation":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast"},{"number":34,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"Yauma yafir-rul mar-u min akheeh","translation":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother"},{"number":35,"arabicText":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"Wa ummihee wa abeeh","translation":"And his mother and his father"},{"number":36,"arabicText":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","transliteration":"Wa sahi batihee wa baneeh.","translation":"And his wife and his children,"},{"number":37,"arabicText":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","transliteration":"Likul limri-im-minuhm yaumaa-izin shaa nuy-yughneeh","translation":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him."},{"number":38,"arabicText":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wujoo huny-yauma-izim-musfira;","translation":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -"},{"number":39,"arabicText":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Dahi katum mustab shirah","translation":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news."},{"number":40,"arabicText":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wa wujoohuy yauma-izin 'alaiha ghabar a","translation":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust."},{"number":41,"arabicText":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","transliteration":"Tarhaquha qatarah.","translation":"Blackness will cover them."},{"number":42,"arabicText":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","transliteration":"Ulaa-ika humul-kafa ratul-fajarah.","translation":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones."}]}